Subject: [PATCH 1031/3799] soh: rename func_808A90F4 ->
 BgRelayObjects_OpenDoor

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: once the switch flag is set, raises the Dampe race door 120 units, plays the sliding-door sfx and arms the run's time limit.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Relay_Objects/z_bg_relay_objects.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Relay_Objects/z_bg_relay_objects.c       | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Relay_Objects/z_bg_relay_objects.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Relay_Objects/z_bg_relay_objects.c
